WEBVTT

00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:15.140
Miyuki-chan?

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:18.250
What?

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:20.310
Does it feel good?

00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:23.030
Yeah.

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:33.540
Miyuki-chan! Miyuki...

00:02:28.440 --> 00:02:29.960
Okay, I'm off.

00:02:30.270 --> 00:02:32.590
I'll make cabbage miso soup today, okay?

00:02:32.590 --> 00:02:33.710
Okay.

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:38.920
"Living Together"

00:02:35.080 --> 00:02:36.210
Wh-What?

00:02:36.930 --> 00:02:39.520
Your hair's still a mess in the back.

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:45.290
When that happens, tell me sooner!

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:57.080
<i>Why doesn't Yoshida-san touch me?</i>

00:02:58.600 --> 00:03:03.530
<i>All he does is make me do chores. 
There's nothing in it for him.</i>

00:03:07.510 --> 00:03:10.760
<i>I know he says he's not into
younger girls, but...</i>

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:15.560
Shouldn't he want to, at least a little?

00:03:24.380 --> 00:03:28.560
Mishima, you can really fix it today, right?

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:31.290
I will! I swear!

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:32.560
Can I sit here?

00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:36.520
Yoshida, I heard you actually turned
down a business trip for once.

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:39.690
Y-Yeah.

00:03:39.690 --> 00:03:42.280
And now I have to go.

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:44.030
I see. Sorry.

00:03:44.030 --> 00:03:45.260
No, no.

00:03:45.260 --> 00:03:47.370
It's not like I'm doing anything.

00:03:47.370 --> 00:03:50.750
I thought you were only into Gotou, anyway.

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:52.210
What are you talking about?

00:03:52.760 --> 00:03:53.820
It's a girl, right?

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:58.700
You have a girlfriend, 
and you don't want to go.

00:03:58.700 --> 00:03:59.340
Am I wrong?

00:03:59.340 --> 00:04:03.300
So you do have a girlfriend, Yoshida-senpai?

00:04:03.830 --> 00:04:06.260
Did things work out with Gotou?

00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:07.260
No.

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:09.160
Don't lie to me.

00:04:09.160 --> 00:04:12.410
There's only one reason somebody
would start turning down business trips:

00:04:12.410 --> 00:04:14.010
They want to be with their girlfriend.

00:04:14.010 --> 00:04:15.600
That's not true.

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:18.360
There are other reasons.

00:04:25.730 --> 00:04:29.540
I'm expecting a package. 
At some point in the next two weeks.

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:33.550
Fine, fine, fine. Forget it.

00:04:33.550 --> 00:04:34.500
I get it.

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:38.460
If you really want to hide it, I won't ask.

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:42.420
But you'd better have enough fun 
to make it worth it.

00:04:42.780 --> 00:04:43.580
Bye.

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:46.630
Ow!

00:04:46.630 --> 00:04:48.250
What was that for?

00:04:48.250 --> 00:04:50.160
Because I'm mad for some reason.

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:52.180
At what?

00:04:52.180 --> 00:04:53.310
At everything!

00:04:57.560 --> 00:04:58.730
Yoshida-senpai!

00:05:00.660 --> 00:05:01.610
I'm done.

00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:05.570
Good work. You kept true to your word.

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:10.450
I did! So reward me by coming
to see a movie with me.

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:15.210
There's a movie theater 
at your station, right?

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:16.420
There is, but...

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:18.120
Then let's go!

00:05:18.120 --> 00:05:19.750
It starts in an hour!

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:21.500
Hey!

00:05:30.370 --> 00:05:31.930
Hello.

00:05:32.480 --> 00:05:33.770
Hello.

00:05:49.210 --> 00:05:51.530
There's nothing to do.

00:05:52.570 --> 00:05:56.250
How long can I stay here?

00:06:06.120 --> 00:06:12.120
<i>Yoshida-san will kick me out when he doesn't
want me anymore, like all the other men.</i>

00:06:13.410 --> 00:06:17.140
<i>For example, if he gets a girlfriend...</i>

00:06:18.680 --> 00:06:20.260
<i>He's so nice.</i>

00:06:20.760 --> 00:06:23.260
<i>He'll get a girlfriend soon.</i>

00:06:23.990 --> 00:06:25.880
<i>And when that happens...</i>

00:06:27.590 --> 00:06:30.860
<i>Will he do it with her?</i>

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:35.900
<i>What is this feeling?</i>

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:42.670
<b>Read</b>

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:42.670
<b>We're having curry for dinner.</b>

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:42.670
<b>Okay. Thanks.</b>

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:42.670
<b>Today</b>

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:42.670
<b>I'm going to a movie at the place near the station with a colleague. 
I'll head home once it's over. I'll eat at home.</b>

00:06:41.360 --> 00:06:42.670
A movie?

00:06:42.670 --> 00:06:44.250
Oh...

00:06:49.920 --> 00:06:53.420
Um... cabbage, fried tofu...

00:06:54.340 --> 00:06:57.470
<i>He doesn't mean Gotou-san, right?</i>

00:06:58.260 --> 00:07:00.600
<i>I wonder if it's a girl.</i>

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:08.240
Just a little...

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:10.450
<b>The World Is So Gray Without You</b>

00:07:09.920 --> 00:07:13.310
I got more out of that than I thought I would.

00:07:13.310 --> 00:07:14.160
You got more out of it?

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:18.120
Yes. How did you enjoy it?

00:07:19.240 --> 00:07:21.420
I'm not sure how to answer that.

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:23.640
Oh, I know.

00:07:23.640 --> 00:07:28.110
What the professor said about you only finding
out if an encounter was fate much later.

00:07:28.110 --> 00:07:30.340
That made sense to me.

00:07:30.340 --> 00:07:32.030
Right?

00:07:32.030 --> 00:07:34.840
I see. So you felt the same way, huh?

00:07:36.940 --> 00:07:39.610
But isn't that boring?

00:07:39.610 --> 00:07:40.520
Boring?

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:46.400
The encounter that's going to change 
your whole life is happening right now.

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:48.980
Not before or after. Right now.

00:07:49.340 --> 00:07:50.940
Yeah, you're right.

00:07:50.940 --> 00:07:57.160
So isn't it better if you realize 
that it's fate the moment it happens?

00:07:58.070 --> 00:07:59.210
Y-Yeah.

00:07:59.210 --> 00:08:04.640
By the time you realize it was fate, 
it was all long gone.

00:08:04.640 --> 00:08:07.630
I'm fine with that happening in a sad story,

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:09.380
but not in reality.

00:08:10.020 --> 00:08:12.190
Right now is what's important to me,

00:08:12.190 --> 00:08:14.840
'cause that's where I'm alive!

00:08:19.460 --> 00:08:22.390
Did you ever have a fated encounter?

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:30.660
Yeah, that's how you are, 
isn't it, Yoshida-san?

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:34.910
At this point, it's almost refreshing.

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:36.870
What are you talking about?

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:40.330
Yes, I've had a fated encounter.

00:08:43.190 --> 00:08:47.000
And that's why I don't want to let it go!

00:08:49.650 --> 00:08:51.710
I see. Do your best with that.

00:08:52.240 --> 00:08:54.260
Yes, I will!

00:09:05.640 --> 00:09:08.440
Wh-What are you—

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:10.520
Your heart skipped a beat there, didn't it?

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:13.420
It did not!

00:09:13.420 --> 00:09:14.740
Get off me!

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:20.410
That was a good movie.

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:24.060
Okay, that's all for today.

00:09:24.060 --> 00:09:26.670
Thanks for coming with me.

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:29.740
No... Uh. Thank you.

00:09:33.880 --> 00:09:38.760
What would you do if I were the person 
you were fated to be with?

00:09:39.070 --> 00:09:42.260
Stop being stupid, and go home!

00:09:57.960 --> 00:10:00.120
<i>The person you were fated to be with?</i>

00:10:01.030 --> 00:10:04.160
<i>That night, was Sayu hoping that somebody—</i>

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:08.600
<i>someone she was fated to be with—
found her?</i>

00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:13.820
<i>And does that mean I found her?</i>

00:10:15.480 --> 00:10:16.520
I'm back.

00:10:17.520 --> 00:10:18.410
Sayu?

00:10:29.080 --> 00:10:33.230
<i>What if... if somebody kidnapped her...</i>

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:41.370
<i>What was that look on his face?</i>

00:10:42.410 --> 00:10:45.330
<i>It wasn't like how he is with me at all.</i>

00:10:48.640 --> 00:10:52.280
I shouldn't care, though, should I?

00:10:58.390 --> 00:10:59.480
Why?

00:11:00.980 --> 00:11:02.060
Why...?

00:11:05.270 --> 00:11:06.420
This can't be happening...

00:11:06.900 --> 00:11:09.430
<i>I'm jealous.</i>

00:11:10.050 --> 00:11:12.250
<i>Of a person whose name I don't even know.</i>

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:17.180
<i>I'm a real idiot.</i>

00:11:21.090 --> 00:11:22.390
You okay?

00:11:28.670 --> 00:11:29.900
You're the girl...

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:33.460
No.

00:11:33.800 --> 00:11:37.230
Are you in high school? 
What are you doing out this late?

00:11:37.230 --> 00:11:38.660
The police will find you.

00:11:42.800 --> 00:11:46.310
Well, they'll leave you alone 
if an adult's with you.

00:11:48.440 --> 00:11:50.930
I'll stay here until the last train.

00:11:53.280 --> 00:11:56.860
So you can think all you want.

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:00.910
Thank you.

00:12:00.910 --> 00:12:02.610
What's your name?

00:12:05.250 --> 00:12:07.280
<i>Damn it! Where is she?</i>

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:09.640
<i>Where are you, Sayu?</i>

00:12:09.640 --> 00:12:10.540
You're a runaway?

00:12:10.890 --> 00:12:12.460
Something like that.

00:12:13.220 --> 00:12:17.500
Well, I ran away a few times in high school.

00:12:18.290 --> 00:12:20.460
Why did you run away?

00:12:24.530 --> 00:12:26.140
Did you get into a fight with your parents?

00:12:26.770 --> 00:12:29.820
No, we didn't.

00:12:30.440 --> 00:12:33.320
We're close, I think.

00:12:33.320 --> 00:12:35.350
And they're unbelievably nice.

00:12:35.350 --> 00:12:37.860
But you ran away anyway?

00:12:40.370 --> 00:12:44.030
I don't think there's such a thing 
as unconditional kindness.

00:12:45.990 --> 00:12:51.100
I think you need some kind of reason 
to be nice to someone.

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:54.440
I think so, too.

00:12:55.160 --> 00:13:00.580
At home... there's somebody 
who's really nice to me.

00:13:01.140 --> 00:13:03.780
And there's something I can't tell them.

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:07.620
If I did, they might abandon me.

00:13:08.400 --> 00:13:10.820
And so you just had to get away?

00:13:12.900 --> 00:13:18.780
There are people like that out there 
sometimes, who are kind in that way.

00:13:19.270 --> 00:13:25.660
You try and think about why they're so nice, 
and you never come up with an answer.

00:13:25.660 --> 00:13:29.000
And once you start thinking about it, 
you just can't stop.

00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:32.200
And then you find yourself 
obsessed with them.

00:13:32.670 --> 00:13:37.170
<i>Is what Yuzuha-san 
talking about Yoshida-san's...</i>

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:40.630
Maybe you're overcome by the fear,

00:13:41.200 --> 00:13:43.240
and you're just frozen in place.

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:47.260
Fear is something really tough 
to deal with, they say.

00:13:47.260 --> 00:13:50.780
It can spur you forward, 
but it can also freeze you in place.

00:13:51.850 --> 00:13:54.060
I heard that in a movie once.

00:13:56.020 --> 00:13:58.730
But don't you think 
it's better to take action?

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:02.690
<i>I see. She feels that way, 
and that's why...</i>

00:14:03.160 --> 00:14:07.690
Even if you do everything you can, 
and it's all for nothing,

00:14:07.690 --> 00:14:09.040
there are still things you can gain.

00:14:09.040 --> 00:14:10.160
Don't you think?

00:14:10.870 --> 00:14:14.680
So don't you have something 
to do, Sayu-chan?

00:14:14.680 --> 00:14:16.120
"Something to do"?

00:14:17.220 --> 00:14:19.080
Show them everything.

00:14:19.480 --> 00:14:20.780
Everything?

00:14:20.780 --> 00:14:23.800
The things you couldn't say. 
The things you were hiding.

00:14:24.170 --> 00:14:31.300
"This is who I am! This is part of me! 
Will you stay with me anyway?"

00:14:32.640 --> 00:14:36.080
And the person you were talking about, 
who's so nice...

00:14:36.080 --> 00:14:39.280
I think they believe in you.

00:14:40.040 --> 00:14:45.230
So why don't you believe in them, too?

00:14:48.440 --> 00:14:51.820
You're right, aren't you?

00:14:54.610 --> 00:14:56.220
I'm going home.

00:14:56.220 --> 00:14:57.410
Sayu!

00:14:59.600 --> 00:15:00.920
Mishima?

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:03.340
What are you doing?

00:15:03.340 --> 00:15:05.170
Why are you here?

00:15:05.610 --> 00:15:07.030
Yoshida-senpai?

00:15:07.560 --> 00:15:09.690
Sayu, come here.

00:15:10.490 --> 00:15:12.840
What are you doing? I was worried.

00:15:12.840 --> 00:15:13.600
I'm sorry.

00:15:13.930 --> 00:15:15.030
Huh?

00:15:15.860 --> 00:15:19.560
Were we talking about the same person?

00:15:20.090 --> 00:15:22.770
You have a good explanation, right?

00:15:24.960 --> 00:15:28.990
I don't know if it'll satisfy you, 
but I'll explain.

00:15:29.940 --> 00:15:34.000
Senpai, is she your child?

00:15:34.000 --> 00:15:34.910
Of course not!

00:15:35.310 --> 00:15:36.730
Right?

00:15:36.730 --> 00:15:38.890
She's a teenage girl!

00:15:38.890 --> 00:15:41.120
But you live with her, right?

00:15:42.610 --> 00:15:44.080
Well, that's right.

00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:51.760
It feels like you two need to spend some
family time together, so I'm going home.

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:53.840
But you owe me an explanation!

00:15:54.560 --> 00:15:55.800
Got it.

00:15:57.800 --> 00:15:59.080
See you later, Sayu-chan.

00:15:59.080 --> 00:16:00.650
Okay...

00:16:05.620 --> 00:16:06.560
Let's go home.

00:16:10.600 --> 00:16:12.760
Yeah. Let's go home.

00:16:25.350 --> 00:16:26.420
Yoshida-san.

00:16:31.850 --> 00:16:34.970
Hey, you... 
What the heck are you doing?

00:16:35.590 --> 00:16:36.640
Get dressed.

00:16:37.080 --> 00:16:38.160
Listen, Yoshida-san!

00:16:38.160 --> 00:16:39.530
I'll listen to what you have to say.

00:16:39.530 --> 00:16:40.470
So get dressed.

00:16:40.470 --> 00:16:41.430
Uh, so—

00:16:41.430 --> 00:16:44.110
Clothes first.

00:16:44.110 --> 00:16:45.030
Listen to me.

00:16:51.810 --> 00:16:56.200
Yoshida-san, you may not feel this way, but...

00:16:56.200 --> 00:17:02.250
I'm a girl, you know, actually.

00:17:02.250 --> 00:17:04.460
No, I know that.

00:17:11.830 --> 00:17:18.260
I think I've got pretty big breasts 
for a high school girl. What do you think?

00:17:18.260 --> 00:17:20.070
Don't ask me.

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:22.430
Do you want to have sex with me?

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:28.230
I told you that if you tried
to seduce me, I'd kick you out.

00:17:28.230 --> 00:17:29.810
All the other men...!

00:17:31.270 --> 00:17:35.180
All the other men wanted to have sex with me!

00:17:39.940 --> 00:17:43.980
Yoshida-san, don't you want to?

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:49.330
You don't want to at all? Even a little?

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:53.780
Hey...

00:17:54.780 --> 00:17:55.840
Stop it!

00:17:56.200 --> 00:17:58.050
I want you to answer me!

00:17:59.160 --> 00:18:01.700
Don't I turn you on?

00:18:08.440 --> 00:18:10.040
You do!

00:18:10.040 --> 00:18:13.570
Do you think any man could resist 
all the stuff you're doing?

00:18:14.970 --> 00:18:18.390
Why are you embarrassed, 
when you're the one doing this?

00:18:18.390 --> 00:18:19.240
Don't be stupid.

00:18:19.960 --> 00:18:21.200
I'm sorry.

00:18:21.530 --> 00:18:24.350
Just get off me, or I'll get mad.

00:18:24.350 --> 00:18:26.200
Okay.

00:18:27.750 --> 00:18:28.810
Um...

00:18:29.480 --> 00:18:30.660
Well...

00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:35.610
I wanted to find a way to live 
without going back home.

00:18:36.950 --> 00:18:42.600
But taking in a teenage girl 
has more disadvantages than advantages.

00:18:43.170 --> 00:18:45.990
If the police find out, 
you could be arrested.

00:18:46.440 --> 00:18:51.100
So... I think there has to
be something to make up for that.

00:18:53.060 --> 00:18:58.030
And so the "advantage"
you decided on was your body?

00:19:00.840 --> 00:19:04.240
At first, I really hated it.

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:10.620
But when we were doing it, I felt like 
I could be myself, like I was needed...

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:13.770
Sometimes it made me feel fulfilled.

00:19:15.230 --> 00:19:21.830
But when the disadvantages win out, 
I'm kicked out.

00:19:21.830 --> 00:19:23.050
And it happens again.

00:19:25.190 --> 00:19:26.560
So you see...

00:19:26.560 --> 00:19:27.770
I don't understand.

00:19:28.790 --> 00:19:33.730
Why do you let me stay here?

00:19:35.810 --> 00:19:39.610
I haven't given you anything.

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:46.220
Anybody can do chores, right? 
It doesn't have to be me doing them.

00:19:47.000 --> 00:19:53.250
I'm causing you a lot of problems, 
but you're always so nice.

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:55.630
Too nice.

00:19:56.240 --> 00:20:01.580
So I think about what I can do to keep you 
from abandoning me, and I get worried.

00:20:01.580 --> 00:20:02.900
I get scared.

00:20:04.320 --> 00:20:05.550
You...

00:20:05.880 --> 00:20:08.770
I don't know what to do now.

00:20:10.120 --> 00:20:12.730
Yoshida-san, if it wouldn't upset you,

00:20:15.220 --> 00:20:17.000
sleep with me.

00:20:18.060 --> 00:20:20.470
If you did, I think I'd feel a little...

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:23.450
What? You're hurting me!

00:20:28.750 --> 00:20:31.870
What are you doing, Yoshida-san? 
I can't breathe!

00:20:32.440 --> 00:20:33.830
No.

00:20:35.810 --> 00:20:38.250
Listen to me. Carefully.

00:20:40.520 --> 00:20:42.670
You're very cute.

00:20:43.220 --> 00:20:46.780
You have a good body
for a teenage girl. A nice face.

00:20:46.780 --> 00:20:48.750
You can do chores. You're awesome.

00:20:48.750 --> 00:20:50.850
Wh-What's all this about?

00:20:51.670 --> 00:20:54.810
But I'm not in love with you.

00:20:56.700 --> 00:20:59.480
And I don't want to sleep with a girl 
I'm not in love with.

00:21:00.480 --> 00:21:05.160
You just said, "If it wouldn't upset you..."

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:06.450
So I'll answer you.

00:21:07.000 --> 00:21:09.420
It would upset me. So, "no."

00:21:09.420 --> 00:21:10.160
Got it?

00:21:11.560 --> 00:21:12.870
Yeah...

00:21:13.680 --> 00:21:14.950
All right.

00:21:15.550 --> 00:21:17.830
Now get dressed already.

00:21:26.520 --> 00:21:27.480
Hey, you...

00:21:28.470 --> 00:21:32.410
You said you haven't done anything for me, 
but that's not true.

00:21:33.190 --> 00:21:35.540
I've changed since you came.

00:21:36.220 --> 00:21:38.560
When I come home, you're here.

00:21:38.560 --> 00:21:41.680
We talk about nothing special. We eat.

00:21:41.680 --> 00:21:43.400
I'm not alone when I go to sleep.

00:21:44.500 --> 00:21:48.680
That makes this place 
so much more pleasant to be.

00:21:49.300 --> 00:21:52.740
I've started feeling like 
I need to hurry home.

00:21:53.800 --> 00:21:59.580
Just having you here 
has made my life a lot more fun.

00:22:02.900 --> 00:22:07.620
So it's not that I want you 
to do anything special.

00:22:08.840 --> 00:22:11.930
I'm just a lonely loser.

00:22:12.550 --> 00:22:16.560
<i>Yeah, I should've said this before.</i>

00:22:16.560 --> 00:22:21.100
<i>I felt like I was helping her 
and getting nothing in return.</i>

00:22:21.100 --> 00:22:25.630
<i>I kept talking about making her 
into an ordinary teenage girl again,</i>

00:22:25.630 --> 00:22:27.150
<i>as though I was protecting her.</i>

00:22:27.750 --> 00:22:30.030
<i>I really believed both those things,</i>

00:22:30.030 --> 00:22:33.990
<i>but it wasn't fair to think 
there wasn't more to it than that.</i>

00:22:34.980 --> 00:22:39.580
Sayu, would you help me out and stay here,

00:22:40.130 --> 00:22:41.930
at least until you feel like going home?

00:22:51.440 --> 00:22:52.970
Is that okay?

00:22:53.230 --> 00:22:56.390
Yeah. Just be here. That's all I ask.

00:22:56.930 --> 00:22:59.470
You're a poor guy, having no libido.

00:22:59.470 --> 00:23:00.410
Right?

00:23:06.930 --> 00:23:08.150
Thanks.

00:23:08.490 --> 00:23:09.230
For what?

00:23:09.610 --> 00:23:12.860
We're both pretty pathetic, huh?

00:23:14.450 --> 00:23:16.750
I feel bad for you, so I'll stay here.

00:23:16.750 --> 00:23:18.660
Yeah, please do.

00:23:20.050 --> 00:23:23.650
<i>It was in this moment, I think</i>

00:23:23.650 --> 00:23:28.310
<i>that we truly started living together.</i>

00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:35.010
<b>Next time</b>

00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:35.010
"Part-Time Job"

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>But I'm watching next week, too!</b>
